msgid ""
"❌ **Don't use unrelaxed structure**: Will give completely wrong Cᵢⱼ ❌ "
"**Don't skip convergence**: Unconverged k-points/basis → unreliable "
"results ❌ **Don't use large strains**: > 2% may cause nonlinear effects ❌"
